  "body": "Step into a house of comfort and sophistication at 9A Penguin Drive—an exceptional near-new, stand-alone residence perfectly positioned in the heart of picturesque Murrays Bay. Imagine living in a space where quality craftsmanship and top-tier finishes come together in flawless harmony – a rare find that delivers true value for your investment. Covered by the balance of 10-Year Master Builder Guarantee for complete peace of mind.\r\n\r\nWith four generously sized bedrooms and 2.5 beautifully appointed bathrooms, including a private master suite, this home offers an abundance of space for families to live, grow, and thrive. The seamless open-plan design creates a natural flow between the gourmet kitchen, elegant dining area, and inviting living room. Whether you’re hosting lively gatherings or enjoying quiet family moments, this space adapts effortlessly to your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the luxury of high-quality flooring underfoot, state-of-the-art appliances, ambient LED lighting, and efficient air-conditioning—ensuring comfort and convenience all year round.\r\n\r\nStep outside to a sun-drenched, low-maintenance courtyard—perfect for morning coffees, alfresco dining, or simply unwinding in the fresh coastal air.\r\n\r\nNestled adjacent to lush nature reserves and just a short stroll to Murrays Bay School, you’ll delight in the ease of daily routines. Rangitoto College sits directly across the street, while the sparkling beach and local amenities are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\n9A Penguin Drive isn’t just a house—it’s a place where memories are made and futures are built. Don’t miss your chance to secure this remarkable home. Contact us today to arrange your viewing and take the next step toward your ideal lifestyle.",
